- {"id": "VER-CS-01", "criterion": "A changeset is a Markdown file whose line 1 is `---`, followed by one `name: severity` entry per line, a closing `---` line and a free-text summary; blank lines and lines starting with `#` inside the frontmatter are ignored. Severities are `major`, `minor`, `patch` and `none` (ordered none < patch < minor < major), read case-insensitively and written lowercase."}
