- {"id": "VER-AGG-03", "criterion": "An entry naming a package not in the workspace, or an invalid name, produces an unknown-package warning, and a changeset with any such unresolved entry stays on disk unconsumed and none of its entries apply (no bump, no changelog line), even when its other entries resolve, until the entry is fixed or removed. An entry with severity `none` causes no bump and no changelog line, but its changeset is still consumed."}
